---
// Services Section matching brightideagroup.com
---

<section id="services" class="bg-[#c9d2d9]/45 py-20" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:section">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:container">
    <!-- Header Row -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start mb-14" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:header-row">
      <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:heading-col">
        <h2 class="leading-[1.3] md:leading-[50.4px] font-bold font-serif text-[#222222] text-[36px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:title">
          Who is Bright Idea Group and what can we do for your law firm?
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:desc-col">
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal text-[#222222]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:desc">
          Our team is made up of agency owners with more than 20 years experience each. Each member of Bright Idea Group is an expert in their individual service areas and has been vetted extensively before joining our group.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 8 Service Cards Grid (2 Columns) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:cards-grid">
      <!-- Card 1: AI Search Optimization -->
      <div class="bg-white grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 rounded-none overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:card-1">
        <div class="relative h-[220px] sm:h-full min-h-[200px] overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:img-wrapper-1">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/06cfb84b/images/68e9ad149fb2838ec812426c_shutterstock_2407537405-768.webp"
            alt="AI Search Optimization"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:img-1"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:content-1">
          <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:text-1">
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[#222222] mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:title-1">
              AI Search Optimization
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[16px] leading-[26px] text-[#222222] mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:p-1">
              AI SEO uses artificial intelligence to optimize website content, improve search rankings, and boost online visibility. It automates keyword research, content optimization, and performance tracking--helping businesses achieve better results faster...
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:link-box-1">
            <a
              href="/service/artificial-intelligence-search-optimization"
              class="text-[#22427D] font-normal text-[16px] hover:underline inline-block"
              data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:link-1"
            >
              Learn more
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Digital Marketing (SEO) -->
      <div class="bg-white grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 rounded-none overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:card-2">
        <div class="relative h-[220px] sm:h-full min-h-[200px] overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:img-wrapper-2">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/06cfb84b/images/68e9ad149fb2838ec812424f_shutterstock_2567392091-768.webp"
            alt="Digital Marketing (SEO)"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:img-2"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:content-2">
          <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:text-2">
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[#222222] mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:title-2">
              Digital Marketing (SEO)
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[16px] leading-[26px] text-[#222222] mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:p-2">
              Traditional SEO is evolving rapidly. In 2025, 60% of searches end without a click [SparkToro, 2024], and AI Overviews now appear in 13.14% of all queries [Semrush, March 2025]. Your business needs a forward-thinking SEO strategy that optimizes for AI search...
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:link-box-2">
            <a
              href="/service/digital-marketng"
              class="text-[#22427D] font-normal text-[16px] hover:underline inline-block"
              data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:link-2"
            >
              Learn more
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Webflow / WP Web Design -->
      <div class="bg-white grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 rounded-none overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:card-3">
        <div class="relative h-[220px] sm:h-full min-h-[200px] overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:img-wrapper-3">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/06cfb84b/images/68e9ad149fb2838ec812426b_shutterstock_2523833227-768.webp"
            alt="Webflow / WP Web Design"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:img-3"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:content-3">
          <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:text-3">
            <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[#222222] mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:title-3">
              Webflow / WP Web Design
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[16px] leading-[26px] text-[#222222] mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:p-3">
              Built on Webflow or WordPress our sites are designed specifically for your firm's practice areas and branding. We focus each site on showcasing your firm's expertise while optimizing for increased conversions. Our sites provide a solid background to your firm's...
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:link-box-3">
            <a
              href="/service/webflow-or-wp-web-design"
              class="text-[#22427D] font-normal text-[16px] hover:underline inline-block"
              data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:link-3"
            >
              Learn more
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Review Management -->
      <div class="bg-white grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 rounded-none overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:card-4">
        <div class="relative h-[220px] sm:h-full min-h-[200px] overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:img-wrapper-4">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/06cfb84b/images/68e9ad149fb2838ec812421d_68d408cd7a2b169a8e8ccba4_shutterstock_2584178699-768.webp"
            alt="Review Management"
