              Accident Reporting / Leads
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[16px] leading-[26px] text-[#222222] mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:p-8">
              Capture potential clients immediately after local incidents with our automated accident reporting system that monitors news feeds and publishes relevant content within minutes. This rapid-response content strategy ensures your firm appears prominently when...
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:link-box-8">
